              '`createMemoryTransportPair(options?: IMemoryTransportOptions)` returns a connected pair. Omitted `options.scheduler` retains native microtask delivery; an injected clock controls only pair delivery, not Endpoint deadlines. There is no structured clone; closing either closes both.'
