                text: 'Use `InitOutput.memory` to create views. This returned object also exposes raw WASM functions. Their conversion results have no JavaScript result-box methods, and raw deallocation returns a number rather than the public `dealloc_bytes()` boolean. Ordinary applications use named exports from the main entry.'
